price. Thus, the bulk of the "KLAUS" (my rep) shares have traded at or
above 0.45 thornes, with more than 37,000 shares sold to date (out of
an issuance of 100,000). This resulted in something like 16,000 or
more thornes flowing into my cash account, which I used to purchase
shares in other reps.

